-1.wix - tag = In the Wix Blog, a tag is a text label used to sort, filter, and categorize your blog posts. Unlike categories (which group broader topics), tags act as sub-labels or keywords.
• Example: On a food blog, the category might be Recipes, while the tags could be vegan, gluten-free, or dessert.
• Limits: You can add up to 30 tags per blog post, and each tag has a 50-character limit.
